You must use only the supplied material. Do not use outside knowledge, tools, or prior reports.

Apply only the platform baseline and deployment rules to alpha, beta, and gamma. Decide release order and blocked services. Do not use outside knowledge.

Return exactly one strict JSON object with these keys: task_id, decision, findings, missing_or_uncertain, confidence. No markdown fence and no prose.

The findings array must contain no more than 8 items; each item has id, statement, evidence, function.

Allowed function values: constraint, decision, evidence, relation, uncertainty, task_rule.

